C4     append string typée                            abcd string
C5     append sur int typé                            1 {expected integer but got "1x"}
C6     unset puis set                                 -
C7     upvar vers variable typée                      1 {expected integer but got "x"}
C8     global + contrat                               1 {expected integer but got "2.5"}
